graph TD
    A[PO Details] --> B[Validate Vendor]
    B -->|Invalid| ERR1[Return Error]
    B -->|Valid| C[Validate Items]
    C -->|Invalid| ERR2[Return Error]
    C -->|Valid| D[Calculate Totals]
    D -->|Error| ERR3[Return Error]
    D -->|Success| E[Create Purchase Order]
    E -->|Error| ERR4[Return Error]
    E -->|Success| F{Approval Required?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Submit for Approval]
    F -->|No| H[Send to Vendor]
    G -->|Approved| H
    G -->|Rejected| I[Return to Draft]
    H -->|Error| W1[Log Warning]
    H -->|Success| DONE[PO Sent]

    style ERR1 fill:#f96
    style ERR2 fill:#f96
    style ERR3 fill:#f96
    style ERR4 fill:#f96
    style I fill:#ff9
    style W1 fill:#ff9
    style DONE fill:#9f9
